            "title1": "What can it do for your skin",
            "drop_txt1": "<p><strong>Ultra hydration.</strong> Hydrates to help plump skin, reducing the look of fine lines and wrinkles, reduce redness, and supports the skin barrier for firmer-feeling, supple looking skin.<br/><br/><strong>Skin Concerns:</strong> Designed for dull looking skin with wrinkles, fine lines, dehydration, dryness and redness.</p>",
