            "drop_txt2": "<p><strong>Beta Glucan:</strong> A tall glass of water for your skin. Boosts skin barrier, smooths skin, antioxidant.</p><p><strong>Niacinamide:</strong> Superstar ingredient that helps with most skin concerns from soothing to brightening and clarifying, and reducing fine lines and wrinkles.</p><p><strong>Copper Peptide GHK-Cu</strong>: known for its powerful anti-aging properties. This switch boosts collagen production and skin healing and gives the serum its distinctive blue hue. </p><p><strong>Sodium Hyaluronate: </strong>Hydrating power to lock in moisture more effectively and plump the skin for a firmer, fresher complexion.</p><p><strong>All ingredients:</strong><br/>Rosa Damascena Flower Water, Propanediol, Glycerin, Panthenol, Niacinamide, Myrothamnus Flabellifolia Leaf/Stem Extract, Water, Butylene Glycol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Copper Tripeptide-1, Beta-Glucan, Chrysanthellum Indicum Extract, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Xanthan Gum.</p><p>Please note that due to innovative updates and changing regulatory guidelines, the ingredient lists provided here may differ slightly from those on our packaging and distributor websites.</p>",
